# Water vapor (GOES band 9), keyed on IEM's 8-bit byte values. The real
# data sits in ~97-160 (median ~129), so the ramp is centered there:
# low byte = dry (warm) -> yellow/orange; high byte = moist (cold) ->
# blue -> bright. Byte 0 = nodata -> transparent.  Format: value R G B A
nv 0 0 0 0
0 0 0 0 0
48 120 60 0 255
100 205 150 55 255
118 200 185 120 255
130 110 130 165 255
142 55 85 165 255
155 40 70 150 255
162 235 242 250 255
255 255 255 255 255
